      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/ChristinMP_/status/2048104688806146350",
      "text": "Bengaluru Traffic Advisory - TCS World 10K (Apr 25, 5-11am):  \"Around 30,000 runners; start/finish at RSAOI Ground. Major roads incl. Cubbon, Kamaraj, Queens, Raj Bhavan & Ambedkar Rd under Halasuru–Shivajinagar will see restrictions. No entry towards Vidhana Soudha; multiple stretches closed/one-way (Cubbon, St John’s, Dickenson, Infantry, Gangadhar Chetty, etc.). Diversions via Cunningham, Palace, MG & Old Madras Rd. No parking on major roads. Use designated parking/pick-up points. Metro runs from 3:30am; avoid driving\" : @blrcitytraffic @Jointcptraffic",
