        "text": "Bengaluru: BMTC will ramp up bus services for the TCS World 10K on April 26. Zonal Divisional Controllers have been directed to ensure smooth operations on routes passing Manekshaw Parade Ground & deploy additional buses based on passenger demand & rowd levels. Commuters can expect improved frequency and better connectivity @BMTC_BENGALURU @osd_cmkarnataka @DrVaishnavi14",
